</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%"><td style="text-align:center; border-style:none" colspan="3"><b>Scoring by quarter:</b> <b>29</b>–26, 16–<b>30</b>, <b>33</b>–32, 30–30</td></tr><tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%">
<td style="width:48%; text-align:right; border-style:none"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_(basketball)" title="Point (basketball)" class="mw-redirect">Pts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giannis_Antetokounmpo" title="Giannis Antetokounmpo">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a> 42<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebound_(basketball)" title="Rebound (basketball)">Rebs</a>:</b> Giannis Antetokounmpo 12<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assist_(basketball)" title="Assist (basketball)">Asts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khris_Middleton" title="Khris Middleton">Khris Middleton</a> 8</td>
<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devin_Booker" title="Devin Booker">Devin Booker</a> 31<br/><b>Rebs:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deandre_Ayton" title="Deandre Ayton">Deandre Ayton</a> 11<br/><b>Asts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Paul" title="Chris Paul">Chris Paul</a> 8</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Phoenix leads series, 2–0</b></i></td></tr>
