</tbody></table>
<table style="background-color:#eee; color:#202122; float:left; width:50%; text-align:center">
<tbody><tr style="vertical-align:top">
<td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phoenix_Suns" title="Phoenix Suns">Phoenix Suns</a> 100, <b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milwaukee_Bucks" title="Milwaukee Bucks">Milwaukee Bucks</a></b> <b>120</b>
</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%"><td style="text-align:center; border-style:none" colspan="3"><b>Scoring by quarter:</b> <b>28</b>–25, 17–<b>35</b>, 31–<b>38</b>, <b>24</b>–22</td></tr><tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%">
<td style="width:48%; text-align:right; border-style:none"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_(basketball)" title="Point (basketball)" class="mw-redirect">Pts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Paul" title="Chris Paul">Chris Paul</a> 19<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebound_(basketball)" title="Rebound (basketball)">Rebs</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deandre_Ayton" title="Deandre Ayton">Deandre Ayton</a> 9<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assist_(basketball)" title="Assist (basketball)">Asts</a>:</b> Chris Paul 9</td>
<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Giannis_Antetokounmpo" title="Giannis Antetokounmpo">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a> 41<br/><b>Rebs:</b> Giannis Antetokounmpo 13<br/><b>Asts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jrue_Holiday" title="Jrue Holiday">Jrue Holiday</a> 9</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Phoenix leads series, 2–1</b></i></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table style="background-color:#eee; color:#202122; float:right; width:24%; table-layout:fixed">
<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fiserv_Forum" title="Fiserv Forum">Fiserv Forum</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milwaukee" title="Milwaukee">Milwaukee, Wisconsin</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 16,637<br/><b>Referees:</b> 
<ul><li>No. 48 <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Foster_(basketball)" title="Scott Foster (basketball)">Scott Foster</a></li>
<li>No. 42 Eric Lewis</li>
<li>No. 60 James Williams</li></ul></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div>
<p id="mwAgM">Antetokounmpo had 41 points, 13 rebounds, and six assists, and Milwaukee won 120–100 at home to cut Phoenix's series lead to 2–1. He received more support from his teammates in Game 3.<sup about="#mwt143" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-buckner_07112021-35"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAgQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgY">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgc">]</span></span></a></sup> Holiday scored 21 points and was 5 of 10 on 3-pointers,<sup about="#mwt144" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAgg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAgk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgo">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAgs">]</span></span></a></sup> and Middleton scored 18.<sup about="#mwt147" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_07112021_36-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_07112021"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ap_07112021-36"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_07112021-36" id="mwAgw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAg0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAg4">[</span>36<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAg8">]</span></span></a></sup> The Suns got 19 points and nine assists from Paul,<sup about="#mwt148" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_07112021_36-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_07112021-36" id="mwAhA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhI">[</span>36<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhM">]</span></span></a></sup> but his fellow guard Booker was limited to 10 points on 3-of-14 shooting, as the Bucks sent multiple defenders at him.<sup about="#mwt149" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAhQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhY">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAhg">The Suns started the game strongly with Ayton scoring 12 points in the first quarter. However, he was limited by foul trouble the rest of the game. Milwaukee took control of the contest with a 30–9 run to end the first half and a 16–0 finish to the third quarter. The Suns pulled to within 74–70 in the third after outscoring the Bucks 14–5, but Milwaukee closed out the quarter with a 24–6 scoring run to lead 98–76.<sup about="#mwt151" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_07112021_36-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_07112021-36" id="mwAhk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAho"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhs">[</span>36<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt152" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-bontemps_07122021_37-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"bontemps_07122021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-bontemps_07122021-37" id="mwAh0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAh4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAh8">[</span>37<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiA">]</span></span></a></sup> The Bucks were 14 of 36 from three-point range for the game after making just 5 of 18 in the first half.<sup about="#mwt153" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAiE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiM">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiQ">]</span></span></a></sup> They limited Phoenix to just nine 3-pointers,<sup about="#mwt154" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_07112021_36-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_07112021-36" id="mwAiU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAic">[</span>36<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAig">]</span></span></a></sup> though Crowder was 6-of-7 from behind the arc and scored 18 points.<sup about="#mwt157" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-38" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-38"}}'><a href="#cite_note-38" id="mwAik"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAio"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAis">[</span>38<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiw">]</span></span></a></sup>  The Bucks also outscored the Suns 54–40 in the paint,<sup about="#mwt158" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAi0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAi4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAi8">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjA">]</span></span></a></sup> and all 14 of Antetokounmpo's field goals were within <span about="#mwt150" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAjE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"convert","href":"./Template:Convert"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"5"},"2":{"wt":"ft"}},"i":0}}]}'>5 feet (1.5</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt150"> </span><span about="#mwt150">m)</span> of the basket.<sup about="#mwt161" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-bontemps_07122021_37-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"bontemps_07122021"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-bontemps_07122021-37"}}'><a href="#cite_note-bontemps_07122021-37" id="mwAjI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjQ">[</span>37<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwAjY">Antetokounmpo became the second player to have consecutive Finals games with at least 40 points and 10 rebounds, joining <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shaquille_O'Neal" title="Shaquille O'Neal" id="mwAjc">Shaquille O'Neal</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2000_NBA_Finals" title="2000 NBA Finals" id="mwAjg">2000</a>.<sup about="#mwt164" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-39" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-39"}}'><a href="#cite_note-39" id="mwAjk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAjo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjs">[</span>39<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAjw">]</span></span></a></sup> He also posted his 11th game in the playoffs with at least 30 points and 10 rebounds, passing <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kareem_Abdul-Jabbar" title="Kareem Abdul-Jabbar" id="mwAj0">Kareem Abdul-Jabbar</a>'s team mark set in 1974 for most in one postseason.<sup about="#mwt165" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ap_07112021_36-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ap_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ap_07112021-36" id="mwAj4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAj8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkA">[</span>36<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkE">]</span></span></a></sup> Antetokounmpo was an improved 13 of 17 on his free throws, as Bucks fans chanted "M-V-P", compared to fans on the road mocking him with a sped-up timer count,<sup about="#mwt166" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-buckner_07112021_35-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"buckner_07112021"}}'><a href="#cite_note-buckner_07112021-35" id="mwAkI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAkM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkQ">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkU">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt169" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-40" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-40"}}'><a href="#cite_note-40" id="mwAkY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAkc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkg">[</span>40<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkk">]</span></span></a></sup> as his lengthy deliberate free throw routine could take longer than the league's 10-second rule to shoot which would result in a violation.<sup about="#mwt172" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-41" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-41"}}'><a href="#cite_note-41" id="mwAko"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAks"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAkw">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAk0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="12" id="mwAk4" aria-labelledby="Game_4"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Game_4">Game 4</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2021_NBA_Finals&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12" title="Edit section: Game 4"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt173" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAk8" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Basketballbox","href":"./Template:Basketballbox"},"params":{"bg":{"wt":"#eee"},"date":{"wt":"July 14"},"time":{"wt":"9:00pm {{small|(8:00pm [[Central Time Zone|CDT]])}}"},"place":{"wt":"[[Fiserv Forum]], [[Milwaukee|Milwaukee, Wisconsin]]"},"TV":{"wt":"[[NBA on ABC|ABC]]"},"team1":{"wt":"[[Phoenix Suns]]"},"score1":{"wt":"103"},"team2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;[[Milwaukee Bucks]]&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"score2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;109&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"report":{"wt":"[https://www.nba.com/game/phx-vs-mil-0042000404 Recap]"},"Q1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;23&apos;&apos;&apos;–20"},"Q2":{"wt":"29–&apos;&apos;&apos;32&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;30&apos;&apos;&apos;–24"},"Q4":{"wt":"21–&apos;&apos;&apos;33&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"points1":{"wt":"[[Devin Booker]] 42"},"points2":{"wt":"[[Khris Middleton]] 40"},"rebounds1":{"wt":"[[Deandre Ayton]] 17"},"rebounds2":{"wt":"[[Giannis Antetokounmpo]] 14"},"assist1":{"wt":"[[Chris Paul]] 7"},"assist2":{"wt":"Giannis Antetokounmpo 8"},"attendance":{"wt":"16,911"},"referee":{"wt":"*No. 19 James Capers\n*No. 16 David Guthrie\n*No. 61 Courtney Kirkland"},"series":{"wt":"Series tied, 2–2"}},"i":0}}]}'></div><div style="width: 100%; background-color:#eee; color:#202122;" about="#mwt173" id="mwAlA">
