<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devin_Booker" title="Devin Booker">Devin Booker</a> 40<br/><b>Rebs:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deandre_Ayton" title="Deandre Ayton">Deandre Ayton</a> 10<br/><b>Asts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Paul" title="Chris Paul">Chris Paul</a> 11</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Milwaukee leads series, 3–2</b></i></td></tr>
